# Google Maps JavaScript API key (Places library enabled) - powers the
# location search/autocomplete on the Add/Edit Property form.
# Restrict this key to your app's domain(s) in the Google Cloud console.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Google Sign-In (OAuth 2.0 Web client ID from Google Cloud Console). Use the
# same client ID as the website and the backend's GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, and add the
# CRM's address under "Authorised JavaScript origins". Leave blank to hide the
# "Continue with Google" button on the sign-in and sign-up pages.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
